      sources: "Sources: Learn, Create an access review of Azure resource and Microsoft Entra roles in PIM. Chapter 07, “Dangers.”",
      say: `Each of these dangers is a review that looks fine and quietly isn't. The worst ties back to Chapter 2: a setting that removes the emergency accounts the first month nobody responds. Close behind are self-reviews, reviews with nobody to step in, and denials that never take effect because auto-apply is off. Some are traps of the API itself: a scope that can't change in place, or a delete that takes the evidence with it. And one the code can't fix alone: a user denied an Azure role still sits in the group that grants it.`,
      detail: `"Remove access" on silence over the emergency accounts' Global Administrator: one missed month removes the accounts the program keeps for the day everything else fails; guard: PA-AR-06 refuses -Apply; PA-AR-E08 flags a denial; Chapter 02's PA-EA-05 sees the loss on the next run. A self-review: assignees approve themselves; role-assignable groups drop out of a self-review of an Entra role; guard: PA-AR-01; PA-AR-E06. One reviewer, no fallback: the review stalls when that person leaves; guard: reviewer groups; PA-AR-02. Auto-apply off: denials change nothing; guard: PA-AR-05; PA-AR-E03 for denials that didn't apply. A rerun of a POST: two series with one name, split evidence; guard: the dry run reads first; PA-AR-12 stops -Apply. A scope change sent as an update: Learn's update API doesn't list scope among the properties it takes, so the change can't be made in place; guard: Replace, left to a person. Deleting a series to replace it: its instances and decisions go with it; guard: the code never deletes; Lab 2 exports evidence first. A role held by a group: a role review would approve the group, not its members; guard: role series cover users; each PRV-* group has its own membership series, and PA-AR-14 flags one that's missing. An Azure role held by a group: a denied user stays in the group; guard: PA-AR-E03 doesn't see it; Chapter 01's inventory and the group's owner do. Bulk approval: decisions without reading; guard: PA-AR-E07; justification required (PA-AR-08). A preview API changes: Azure series fail or change shape; guard: -IncludePreview only; Lab 2 step 6; the source watch on the tutorial. A write permission on a read-only job: a compromised reader can change reviews; guard: separate tasks and identities; tests pin the permissions. Evidence names people: decisions.csv holds names and UPNs; guard: treat the output folder as evidence; delete lab copies.`,
