      say: `Here's what done looks like. Every privileged role, every privileged group, and every privileged Azure role at the control-plane subscriptions has its own series, and none of them is a self-review. The cadence matches the tier, auto-apply is on, and only the emergency accounts' series keeps access on silence. The identities hold only what their task needs, preview Azure series wait for the lab, and every closed review has its decisions in the evidence store. Next, Chapter 8 brings it all together: evidence and drift, for the ISSO. Thanks for watching.`,
